## COMMUNITY LANDING PAGES
# Powers the "latest posts" gallery on the CryptosiastDAO Bali page via Meta's Business
# Discovery API — free, and does NOT require any cooperation from @cryptosiastbali (it just
# needs to stay a public Business/Creator account, which is Instagram's default nudge for
# most brand/community profiles anyway). What IS required is OUR OWN Instagram Business
# account:
#   1. Have (or create) a Paradapp Instagram account, convert it to Business/Creator, and
#      link it to a Facebook Page.
#   2. Create an app at developers.facebook.com, add "Instagram Graph API", connect that
#      Page, and generate a long-lived access token for it.
#   3. PARADAPP_IG_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID is that connected account's numeric IG user id
#      (from the Page's instagram_business_account field via the Graph API Explorer).
# Leave either empty to fall back to the static gallery grid — used by
# src/app/api/instagram-feed/route.ts.
PARADAPP_IG_ACCESS_TOKEN=
PARADAPP_IG_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID=


# The operator node's tunnel API (conversions between two networks), called
# only by this app's server (/api/tunnel). The key is the node's
# tunnel_api.key_env value: never a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
TUNNEL_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
TUNNEL_API_KEY=
